lor":"e4e4e4","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-01-06T14:23:17Z","updated_at":"2026-01-13T10:14:41Z","closed_at":"2026-01-13T10:14:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.1 stable and current master commit c742d107\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.1.stable - Arch Linux #1 SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Fri, 02 Jan 2026 17:52:55 +0000 on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Laptop GPU - Intel(R) Core(TM) Ultra 9 185H (22 threads) - 30.73 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nMy Settings page has an option to move the game window to a different screen when in fullscreen mode.\nThis works fine on Windows and on Wine, but on X11 it doesn't move the game to the other screen.\n\nThe following workaround fixes the issue:\n```gdscript\nDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED)\nDisplayServer.window_set_current_screen(1)\nDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN)\n```\ndisplay_server_x11.cpp has dedicated handling for the modes WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN and WINDOW_MODE_MAXIMIZED but WINDOW_MODE_EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN has the same issue as well.\n\nIt's not a major issue but it can lead to confusion since the documentation of the method explicitly says that it is implemented for X11: https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_displayserver.html#class-displayserver-method-window-set-current-screen\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Have 2 displays connected.\n- Create a scene with 1 button.\n- Add this code to the buttons pressed() signal:\n```gdscript\nfunc _on_button_pressed() -> void:\n\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN)\n\tif DisplayServer.window_get_current_screen() == 0:\n\t\tDisplayServer.window_set_current_screen(1)\n\telse:\n\t\tDisplayServer.window_set_current_screen(0)\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","clo